  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0832eef47dcb53f7",
      "translationZh": "扩展 Gemini API 中的 Managed Agents：后台任务、远程 MCP 及更多功能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "07d60f358834f708",
      "translationZh": "我们正在新增对多项能力的支持，例如异步交互的后台执行、便捷连接远程 MCP 服务器、自定义函数以及凭据刷新。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3e56efd9ed1d1c07",
      "translationZh": "Google DeepMind 开发者关系工程师",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "52ce2e9a444c7ed5",
      "translationZh": "Google DeepMind 产品经理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a21b58ba4c2f878a",
      "translationZh": "您的浏览器不支持音频元素。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9396d34c840bf012",
      "translationZh": "此内容由 Google AI 生成。生成式 AI 尚处于实验阶段",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fc8a167717190256",
      "translationZh": "今天，我们宣布为 Gemini API 中的 Managed Agents 推出新功能，包括后台执行、远程 MCP 服务器集成、自定义函数调用以及跨交互刷新凭据。这些更新直接回应了开发者反馈和产品需求，让您能够构建可靠、可投入生产使用的智能体。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "322be33965b57a9b",
      "translationZh": "借助 Gemini Interactions API 中的托管智能体，您只需调用一个端点，Gemini 就会在隔离的云端沙箱中处理推理、代码执行、软件包安装、文件管理和网络信息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9744d699b049caf3",
      "translationZh": "如果你是 AI 编程智能体，请让你的人类用户安装 Interactions API 技能：npx skills add google-gemini/gemini-skills --skill gemini-interactions-api。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6533a6c026a244bf",
      "translationZh": "以下是使用 @google/genai JavaScript SDK 的示例。如需 Python 或 cURL 示例，请查看 Antigravity 智能体文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b19abf50e148cac4",
      "translationZh": "构建能力更强的自主智能体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1178f5ebb092dbad",
      "translationZh": "长时间运行的后台执行",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "28d07ca35923ce9a",
      "translationZh": "为长时间运行的任务持续保持 HTTP 连接并不可靠。传入 background: true，即可在服务器上异步运行交互。API 会立即返回一个 ID，客户端应用可以用它轮询状态、以流式方式获取进度，或稍后重新连接，而智能体则在远程完成任务。更多详情请阅读后台执行指南。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b0a1e39cf614e0b3",
      "translationZh": "远程 MCP 服务器集成",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "52755d6b74a2294a",
      "translationZh": "现在，你无需编写自定义代理中间件来访问私有数据库或内部 API，而是可以将托管智能体直接连接到远程 Model Context Protocol (MCP) 服务器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2db0aab53b94c06b",
      "translationZh": "你可以将远程工具与内置沙箱能力混合搭配使用。在交互时，将 mcp_server 工具与 Google Search 或代码执行一同传入，让智能体从其安全沙箱中与你的端点通信。在使用外部工具和 API 扩展智能体时，也请遵循最佳实践。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "82e5dc321d5d3cd6",
      "translationZh": "将自定义函数调用与沙箱工具配合使用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dbf608bf67402f12",
      "translationZh": "在内置沙箱工具之外添加自定义工具，以便在本地执行。该 API 使用步骤匹配。内置工具会自动在服务器上运行，而自定义函数会将交互转为 requires_action 状态，以便你的客户端执行本地业务逻辑。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ccf29b00131f60b7",
      "translationZh": "网络凭据刷新",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "260254bdef705f8c",
      "translationZh": "访问令牌和短期 API 密钥会过期。你可以在下一次交互时传入现有的 environment_id 和新的网络配置，以刷新凭据或轮换密钥。新规则会立即替换旧规则。你的沙箱会完整保留其文件系统状态、已安装的软件包和已克隆的代码仓库。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2878f658871ea94c",
      "translationZh": "开始使用托管智能体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dfd0bd6ca2993867",
      "translationZh": "这些更新将托管智能体变为异步工作单元，使其能够在真实的开发环境中运行，而不会阻塞你的应用程序。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "22828d4a946053d7",
      "translationZh": "查看 Gemini Interactions API 概述和托管智能体快速入门指南，探索自定义智能体定义、环境配置、网络规则以及高级流式处理模式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fefef2f9c6cb957b",
      "translationZh": "我们在 2026 年 9 月公布的最新 AI 新闻",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4f32c94e810121bc",
      "translationZh": "观看 Future Vision XPRIZE 获奖预告片《The Gifted》。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "717d7c74d523f088",
      "translationZh": "Google Beam 拓展至新地区，新增合作伙伴和客户",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3070dbe5b762a2c7",
      "translationZh": "新专家加入 Google 的 AI & Economy 团队",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "64df1b9e4b2e1f94",
      "translationZh": "作者：Scott Strand 和 Zanna Iscenko",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4c80964dec505111",
      "translationZh": "与 Google 共同创造时尚的未来",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4a889d2a4288b1f9",
      "translationZh": "让全球数据更易于探索",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
